{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114021","id":3100208265,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc64yWyJ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114021","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114021.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114021.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114021","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114021/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114021/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114021/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6c503b9e830a1cd70dfae54c9492c737b46e99b5","number":114021,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `noperspective` back into glslang and add Affine texture mapping to BaseMaterial3D","user":{"login":"shittyprogrammer445","id":96263419,"node_id":"U_kgDOBbzc-w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96263419?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445","html_url":"https://github.com/shittyprogrammer445","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shittyprogrammer445/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds [affine texture mapping](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Texture_mapping#Affine_texture_mapping) to BaseMaterial3D and adds `noperspective` back into glslang.\r\n\r\nThis effect is useful for retro graphics, such as recreating the visual style of the original Playstation. I personally made this to prevent having to do several different StandardMaterial3D -> ShaderMaterial conversions due to code repetition, then expanded it to having the `noperspective` option in glslang due to a comment under this PR.\r\n\r\nThis is an effect with very little use case outside of PSX style games, but I see many PSX games being made in Godot so I believe it may benefit by having this option be something out of the box.\r\n\r\n~~This effect works by reversing the perspective correction that the GPU does. This is usually done via a `noperspective` keyword in the shader language, but I could not find documentation saying that there was such keyword in glslang.~~\r\nThe reversing part is only true for `gl_compatibility`, as GLES3 doesn't support `noperspective` without extensions. The other two rendering modes use the GLSL keyword `noperspective`. The rest of the statement is outdated as of this PR.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"541\" height=\"150\" alt=\"affine3\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0a7789ec-f201-48d2-ac8b-b37cbc696873\" />\r\n<img width=\"1211\" height=\"1192\" alt=\"affine2\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9b05349a-f5e9-4232-942c-9e9fec64fe0e\" />\r\n<img width=\"1247\" height=\"765\" alt=\"affine1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdac0032-6932-4503-b116-39cf2ffbbd4d\" />\r\n<img width=\"1279\" height=\"766\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3858793d-9e26-4e18-84d4-c1becb9cfaec\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20pr